            <div xml:id="d1645">

                <pb facs="1409" n="1305" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1305"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 816.001Ar1/2.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 9, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Araújo died at half past four o’clock this afternoon. The Presidential
                    Power has been vested in Señor Carlos Meléndez, the First Substitute.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Heimke</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
